---
// How a histogram estimates the p99 of the 1,000 requests in LongTail: find the bucket that holds
// the 990th request (250-500 ms, running total 980 -> 992), then assume its 12 requests are spread
// evenly and read off the 10th: 250 + 250 x 10 / 12 = about 458 ms. Matches histogram.py's method.
---

<svg viewBox="0 0 400 330" width="100%" role="img" aria-labelledby="ptl-bk-t ptl-bk-d">
  <title id="ptl-bk-t">Estimating the p99 from bucket counts</title>
  <desc id="ptl-bk-d">
    Top: eight boxes, the counts of the eight time ranges from the earlier chart: 120, 610, 160, 60,
    30, 12, 5 and 3. Under them, the running total: 120, 730, 890, 950, 980, 992, 997, 1,000. The
    990th request is in the sixth box, 250 to 500 ms, because the total passes 990 there. Bottom: that
    range drawn as a line from 250 to 500 ms with its 12 requests spread evenly along it; the 10th is
    highlighted at about 458 ms. The real 10th request could be anywhere in the range.
  </desc>
  <text x="22" y="40" font-size="17" font-weight="700" style="fill: var(--viz-ink)">we need the 990th of 1,000 requests</text>
  <rect x="22" y="58" width="42" height="34" rx="4" stroke-width="1.5" style="fill: var(--viz-flow-soft); stroke: var(--viz-flow)" />
  <text x="43" y="81" font-size="16" text-anchor="middle" style="fill: var(--viz-ink)">120</text>
  <text x="43" y="114" font-size="15" text-anchor="middle" style="fill: var(--viz-muted)">120</text>
  <rect x="68" y="58" width="42" height="34" rx="4" stroke-width="1.5" style="fill: var(--viz-flow-soft); stroke: var(--viz-flow)" />
  <text x="89" y="81" font-size="16" text-anchor="middle" style="fill: var(--viz-ink)">610</text>
  <text x="89" y="114" font-size="15" text-anchor="middle" style="fill: var(--viz-muted)">730</text>
  <rect x="114" y="58" width="42" height="34" rx="4" stroke-width="1.5" style="fill: var(--viz-flow-soft); stroke: var(--viz-flow)" />
  <text x="135" y="81" font-size="16" text-anchor="middle" style="fill: var(--viz-ink)">160</text>
  <text x="135" y="114" font-size="15" text-anchor="middle" style="fill: var(--viz-muted)">890</text>
  <rect x="160" y="58" width="42" height="34" rx="4" stroke-width="1.5" style="fill: var(--viz-flow-soft); stroke: var(--viz-flow)" />
  <text x="181" y="81" font-size="16" text-anchor="middle" style="fill: var(--viz-ink)">60</text>
  <text x="181" y="114" font-size="15" text-anchor="middle" style="fill: var(--viz-muted)">950</text>
  <rect x="206" y="58" width="42" height="34" rx="4" stroke-width="1.5" style="fill: var(--viz-flow-soft); stroke: var(--viz-flow)" />
  <text x="227" y="81" font-size="16" text-anchor="middle" style="fill: var(--viz-ink)">30</text>
  <text x="227" y="114" font-size="15" text-anchor="middle" style="fill: var(--viz-muted)">980</text>
  <rect x="252" y="58" width="42" height="34" rx="4" stroke-width="2.5" style="fill: var(--viz-warn-soft); stroke: var(--viz-ink)" />
  <text x="273" y="81" font-size="16" text-anchor="middle" style="fill: var(--viz-ink)">12</text>
  <text x="273" y="114" font-size="15" text-anchor="middle" style="fill: var(--viz-ink)" font-weight="700">992</text>
  <rect x="298" y="58" width="42" height="34" rx="4" stroke-width="1.5" style="fill: var(--viz-flow-soft); stroke: var(--viz-flow)" />
  <text x="319" y="81" font-size="16" text-anchor="middle" style="fill: var(--viz-ink)">5</text>
  <text x="319" y="114" font-size="15" text-anchor="middle" style="fill: var(--viz-muted)">997</text>
  <rect x="344" y="58" width="42" height="34" rx="4" stroke-width="1.5" style="fill: var(--viz-flow-soft); stroke: var(--viz-flow)" />
  <text x="365" y="81" font-size="16" text-anchor="middle" style="fill: var(--viz-ink)">3</text>
  <text x="365" y="114" font-size="15" text-anchor="middle" style="fill: var(--viz-muted)">1000</text>
  <text x="22" y="138" font-size="15" style="fill: var(--viz-muted)">running total: 980 before the box, 992 after</text>
  <line x1="275" y1="120" x2="200" y2="178" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="4 4" style="stroke: var(--viz-muted)" />
  <line x1="40" y1="214" x2="360" y2="214" stroke-width="2" style="stroke: var(--viz-stroke)" />
  <line x1="40" y1="200" x2="40" y2="228" stroke-width="2" style="stroke: var(--viz-stroke)" />
  <line x1="360" y1="200" x2="360" y2="228" stroke-width="2" style="stroke: var(--viz-stroke)" />
  <text x="200" y="186" font-size="16" text-anchor="middle" style="fill: var(--viz-ink)">its 12 requests, assumed evenly spread</text>
  <circle cx="53.3" cy="214" r="6" stroke-width="1.5" style="fill: var(--viz-warn-soft); stroke: var(--viz-warn)" />
  <circle cx="80.0" cy="214" r="6" stroke-width="1.5" style="fill: var(--viz-warn-soft); stroke: var(--viz-warn)" />
  <circle cx="106.7" cy="214" r="6" stroke-width="1.5" style="fill: var(--viz-warn-soft); stroke: var(--viz-warn)" />
  <circle cx="133.3" cy="214" r="6" stroke-width="1.5" style="fill: var(--viz-warn-soft); stroke: var(--viz-warn)" />
  <circle cx="160.0" cy="214" r="6" stroke-width="1.5" style="fill: var(--viz-warn-soft); stroke: var(--viz-warn)" />
  <circle cx="186.7" cy="214" r="6" stroke-width="1.5" style="fill: var(--viz-warn-soft); stroke: var(--viz-warn)" />
  <circle cx="213.3" cy="214" r="6" stroke-width="1.5" style="fill: var(--viz-warn-soft); stroke: var(--viz-warn)" />
  <circle cx="240.0" cy="214" r="6" stroke-width="1.5" style="fill: var(--viz-warn-soft); stroke: var(--viz-warn)" />
  <circle cx="266.7" cy="214" r="6" stroke-width="1.5" style="fill: var(--viz-warn-soft); stroke: var(--viz-warn)" />
  <circle cx="293.3" cy="214" r="8" stroke-width="2.5" style="fill: var(--viz-bad); stroke: var(--viz-ink)" />
  <circle cx="320.0" cy="214" r="6" stroke-width="1.5" style="fill: var(--viz-warn-soft); stroke: var(--viz-warn)" />
  <circle cx="346.7" cy="214" r="6" stroke-width="1.5" style="fill: var(--viz-warn-soft); stroke: var(--viz-warn)" />
  <text x="40" y="248" font-size="15" text-anchor="middle" style="fill: var(--viz-muted)">250 ms</text>
  <text x="360" y="248" font-size="15" text-anchor="end" style="fill: var(--viz-muted)">500 ms</text>
  <text x="293.3" y="272" font-size="15" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" style="fill: var(--viz-ink)">10th of 12</text>
  <text x="22" y="300" font-size="16" font-weight="700" style="fill: var(--viz-ink)">guess: 250 + 250 × 10 ÷ 12 ≈ 458 ms</text>
  <text x="22" y="322" font-size="15" style="fill: var(--viz-muted)">the real one could be anywhere from 250 to 500</text>
</svg>
